<title>USA: Imation Corp sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Imation Corp sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>OAKDALE, Minn. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imation Corp said Tuesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to two million shares.</p>
<p>As of December 31, 1996, Imation said it had 42,879,880 shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
